    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2322" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Amphĭlŏchus</span></b> ,
		i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀμφίλοχος</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Son of Amphiarāus</i>, <i>founder of</i> Argos Amphilochium, <i>in
			Epirus</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 1, 2, § 3</span></i>.
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Son of Alcmœon and Manto</i>, <i>who</i>, <i>as a seer had a temple at
				Oropus</i>, <i>in Attica</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 45,
			27</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
